cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the associated manuscript and this repository."
title: "insomnia-resting-eeg: Resting-state EEG pipeline and principal component analysis and clustering of insomnia symptoms"
abstract: >-
  De-identified research code for the EEG conversion, preprocessing, PSD
  extraction and periodic/aperiodic (FOOOF) feature-generation workflow, and
  for the principal component analysis and clustering of Insomnia Severity
  Index items used in the associated manuscript. No participant data are
  included.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Sleep and Affective Science Lab, Division of Clinical Psychology, Department of Psychology, Asia University"
    website: "https://sleepaffect.org"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/sleepaffect/insomnia-resting-eeg"
url: "https://sleepaffect.org"
keywords:
  - EEG
  - EEGLAB
  - FOOOF
  - spectral parameterization
  - aperiodic
  - preprocessing
  - NeuroGuide
